  "privacyTitle": "Your privacy",
  "privacyBody": "DAWASA stores all of your financial and personal records only on this phone, in the app's private storage.\n\n• No account, login or registration.\n• No advertising, analytics or tracking.\n• No financial data is ever sent to any server.\n• Android cloud backup of app data is disabled, so your records are not copied to online storage.\n• Backups are encrypted with a password only you know (AES-256-GCM). Without the password nobody — including the developer — can read them.\n• The only internet connection DAWASA makes is to the update server, and only to download the update description and the new app file. No personal data is included in these requests.\n• Receipt photos are copied into the app's private storage and never uploaded.",
